  "title": "Create Ultimate Selection 2 - Create Aeronautics",
  "description": "NEW CREATE AERONAUTICS! Unlock the full potential of engineering, automation, and innovation with the best Create mods.",
  "body": "<div><div><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection_2/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_2_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>CREATE 6.0.9 For MC 1.21.1 - NEW QUESTS NOW&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">After the success of&nbsp;<em>Create: Ultimate Selection</em>, <em>Create: Ultimate Selection 2</em> arrives for Minecraft 1.21.1 with a carefully curated selection of the best Create mods, their most exciting addons, and top-tier technology mods. Fully integrated and optimized, this pack offers a unique and seamless experience of engineering and automation.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Explore new ways to build complex machines, automated systems, and advanced technology that will completely transform your world. With powerful and innovative tools, you can design, experiment, and push the limits of creativity without restrictions. From intricate transportation networks to massive automated factories, <em>Create: Ultimate Selection 2</em> gives you everything you need to take your engineering skills to the next level, &nbsp;whether solo or in multiplayer with friends</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection_2/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_2_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Explore new ways to build complex machines, automated systems, and advanced technology that will completely transform your world. With powerful and innovative tools, you can design, experiment, and push the limits of creativity without restrictions.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">From intricate transportation networks to massive automated factories,&nbsp;<em>Create: Ultimate Selection 2</em> gives you everything you need to take your engineering skills to the next level</span></div><div>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">You can design intricate machines, automate large-sacale production, and explore endless engineering possibilities. From precision tools to massive factories, everything works together out of the box, giving you the freedom to focus on creativity and innovation.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Whether you play solo or with friends, this modpack is your gateway to building the most advanced engineering projects Minecraft has ever seen.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>⚙️<strong>Want to build massive Create factories with friends?</strong></strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection_2/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_2_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p><div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>Get your own Minecraft server today</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"> and enjoy endless adventures with your friends!&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Create can become demanding once your world fills with moving contraptions and complex production systems.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">I personally use <strong>BisectHosting</strong> to test and host <em>Create Ultimate Selection 2</em> because of its stable performance and easy one-click modpack installation. If you're going multiplayer, don’t risk lag or setup headaches.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Use code&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>for a </span><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">25% discount!</span></strong></a></span></span></p></div></div></div><div>&nbsp;</div></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Create_Ultimate_Selection_2/BH_Create_Ultimate_Selection_2_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324409/description_c3233257-5b3c-4c1d-b02e-e96ab90a9f6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324409/description_3e054bdc-4eae-43f9-9b71-4bbef2ee5e5b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span>\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1324409/description_c8443582-2afd-491c-a607-1